{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p></p>\n<p>天文台於今日（11月18日）上午8時45分發出特別天氣提示，指出一道冷鋒正逐漸向南移動，預計稍後橫過廣東沿岸地區。本港今日會有一兩陣雨，晚上氣溫下降，市民需注意天氣變化。\n</p>\n<p>隨後一兩日天氣顯著轉涼，星期五及星期六市區最低氣溫預計在15至16度，新界地區則可能再低兩至三度。此外，受強烈東北季候風影響，星期五及星期六初時高地風寒效應會較為明顯，氣溫寒冷。</p>\n<p>天文台提醒市民，特別是進行戶外活動的人士，需注意保暖，並關顧長者及慢性病患者。建議穿著保暖衣物，避免長時間暴露於寒冷環境中，以減少健康風險。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%86%b7%e9%8b%92/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">冷鋒</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a4%a9%e6%96%87%e5%8f%b0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">天文台</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%89%b9%e5%88%a5%e5%a4%a9%e6%b0%a3%e6%8f%90%e7%a4%ba/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">特別天氣提示</a> </p>\n<p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生活</a>\nNov 18 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T01:03:01.149475+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":282,"images":0,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T00:45:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T03:38:36.600823+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T00:56:35.564302+00:00","content_hash":"26d22bc0800ce0d62258676855107cf0748cd561a26f05161b79b5147bde1920","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}